      conversation: Oh! Are you going to register? I bet this is your first time to register. I've never seen anyone as stiff as you. Do you understand the terms of registration? I can assure you that you could always come to me to get some treatment until you reach level 15. Please do visit me in case you need some treatment. Don't you think it'll be more convenient if you change your Save Point over here?
