  - statementId: 17
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: The quality and quantity of medicine supplies are not good at all. This causes us to produce our own means of acquiring medicine supplies. Excuse me. Would you be willing to help me collect some Cigarette Butts? Have you ever heard of the two notorious chain-smokers around? They are the Little Hooligan and the Hooligan. The last time I requested for cigarette butts from someone, I found out that the quality of the cigarette butts from the Little Hooligan are not of good quality. I couldn't use them to produce medicinal materials. Would you help me acquire cigarette butts from the Hooligan instead? Ah! Don't worry. I'll exchange some of my money with you if you get me 20 cigarette Butts from the Hooligan.
      condition:
        isEnable: 1
        classRequiremnet:
          brawlerMale: 1
          swordsmanMale: 1
