  - statementId: 19
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: We are not just experiencing a shortage in medicines but also a shortage in medical supplies used for treatment. If the situation continues to be like this, we have to come up with procedures to acquire all necessary medicine supplies and equipments by ourselves. I just had a great idea! There is a group of mobs outside called Street Junkie. They carry and wear bandages and plasters. Yes! I remember these fellas actually carry bandages in their pockets. These Street Junkie’s really don't need those bandages. I believe that other students will benefit a lot from those bandages. Having said that, will you help me get bandages from the Street Junkie? The supplies for bandages are minimal. We should therefore acquire these bandages to compensate the need for it.
      condition:
        isEnable: 1
        classRequiremnet:
